{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/GIF_GamePlay_1.gif?t=1745221594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300eMini Cozy Room : Lo-Fi\u300f</strong> is a relaxing productivity game that combines soothing Lo-Fi music with cozy room decoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute avatars and pets will accompany you, making your work more enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Convenient desktop tools like Pomodoro timers, notes, and to-do lists will boost your productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>1. Your Own Cozy Workspace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the workspace you've always dreamed of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from various rooms, furniture, and decorative items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your beautifully designed workspace will enhance concentration and productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/GIF_GamePlay_2.gif?t=1745221594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>2. Soothing Lo-Fi Music &amp; Ambience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill your workspace with diverse Lo-Fi music genres and calming ambient sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll soon find yourself relaxed and deeply immersed in your tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/GIF_GamePlay_3.gif?t=1745221594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>3. Innovative Desktop UI and Mini Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely reposition and resize notes and to-do lists on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feeling overwhelmed by the large game screen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch to Mini Mode and conveniently place it in your taskbar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/GIF_GamePlay_4.gif?t=1745221594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>4. Cute Avatars and Pets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Express your unique style with diverse fashion options, hairstyles, and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move adorable avatars to chairs, beds, or beanbags and assign tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lovely pets like cats, dogs, and hedgehogs will keep you company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>5. Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain experience points by listening to music. Higher levels deliver gift parcels to your workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up to unlock new items and content!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy beautiful music and ambient sounds without the burden of streaming data.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level Up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511030/c517897d393dc0f377dc69281ff69c99c4b8e974.jpg"},{"name":"New Companion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511030/f2401bd5d20b5350085f905caec1edf565caf42f.jpg"},{"name":"Lo-Fi Critic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511030/eada376e8be2295b4702ae3a7287522350f9b272.jpg"},{"name":"Layers of Calm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511030/a9e8bc7f8de8ecb0e50915863b602f235ca65695.jpg"},{"name":"Home Stylist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511030/36285f7c19898e164c074a6db4f2a0eb220371ae.jpg"},{"name":"New Space","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511030/c5c27c892b919df5b2ea9ffedd633fbe83a9c039.jpg"},{"name":"Time Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511030/a4b02440e781803ad5507ecd9d949dc3867138dd.jpg"},{"name":"Task Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511030/7bfd2f22650d08dda399687b21d5bc9c0f3936cd.jpg"},{"name":"Lo-Fi Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511030/ac76dae9eb4d63237c625315c686d51d223ed3d2.jpg"},{"name":"Cozy Curator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511030/4629f20e030b9f9656ffc31d0d43bd8e9cf3c39a.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3511030?t=1745221594","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/55f5319272b7c936c6e3af12c153f1e6c5a5173a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745221594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/3f458fa2d355f264842c53b9964709056af6ea18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745221594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/3f458fa2d355f264842c53b9964709056af6ea18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745221594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3550820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/GIF_GamePlay_1.gif?t=1745221594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300eMini Cozy Room : Lo-Fi\u300f</strong> is a relaxing productivity game that combines soothing Lo-Fi music with cozy room decoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute avatars and pets will accompany you, making your work more enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Convenient desktop tools like Pomodoro timers, notes, and to-do lists will boost your productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>1. Your Own Cozy Workspace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the workspace you've always dreamed of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from various rooms, furniture, and decorative items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your beautifully designed workspace will enhance concentration and productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/GIF_GamePlay_2.gif?t=1745221594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>2. Soothing Lo-Fi Music &amp; Ambience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill your workspace with diverse Lo-Fi music genres and calming ambient sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll soon find yourself relaxed and deeply immersed in your tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/GIF_GamePlay_3.gif?t=1745221594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>3. Innovative Desktop UI and Mini Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely reposition and resize notes and to-do lists on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feeling overwhelmed by the large game screen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch to Mini Mode and conveniently place it in your taskbar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/extras/GIF_GamePlay_4.gif?t=1745221594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>4. Cute Avatars and Pets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Express your unique style with diverse fashion options, hairstyles, and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move adorable avatars to chairs, beds, or beanbags and assign tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lovely pets like cats, dogs, and hedgehogs will keep you company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>5. Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain experience points by listening to music. Higher levels deliver gift parcels to your workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up to unlock new items and content!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy beautiful music and ambient sounds without the burden of streaming data.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Tesseract Studio","Nugem Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511030/63c576a458ec79183c38d2a2961e22425d983006/header.jpg?t=1745221594","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116250,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116250/movie480.mp4?t=1742491317","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116250/movie_max.mp4?t=1742491317"},"name":"MCR_2nd Trailer_english","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116250/67b3c59b4a94b033e4c05a17d246d68e9a32838a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742491317","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116250/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742491317","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116250/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742491317"}}],"name":"Mini Cozy Room: Lo-Fi","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Mini Cozy Room : Lo-Fi - $4.99 USD","packageid":1239578,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":499}],"title":"Buy Mini Cozy Room: Lo-Fi"}],"packages":[1239578],"